WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:14.680
The fictional customer's three-line purchase order shows item codes, quantities and prices.

2
00:00:26.040 --> 00:00:32.000
DocIQ, iMBrace's document reader, selects the purchase-order model for this PDF.

3
00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:53.520
Each value is read, then matched with item codes, prices and available stock.

4
00:01:04.440 --> 00:01:10.720
One unclear line pauses the order and creates a question for the customer.

5
00:01:28.760 --> 00:01:38.400
The demo email board holds the question and three choices for the customer.

6
00:01:55.520 --> 00:02:00.480
An automated test enters the customer's reply in the visible form.

7
00:02:00.480 --> 00:02:12.160
The recorded reply selects the offered substitute and identifies the automated customer role.

8
00:02:12.160 --> 00:02:15.840
Saving the reply resumes the waiting order.

9
00:02:15.880 --> 00:02:47.100
The selected choice is checked before the order desk's approval.

10
00:02:47.100 --> 00:02:53.420
The order waits for the order desk's decision.

11
00:02:53.420 --> 00:03:03.220
The workflow checks that the reply matches an offered substitute.

12
00:03:03.220 --> 00:03:13.940
The recorded reply selects premium towels at HKD 52 each.

13
00:03:25.860 --> 00:03:32.420
A resent purchase order arrives while the original waits for approval.

14
00:03:33.180 --> 00:03:49.820
The decisions board brings the current order into view.

15
00:03:49.820 --> 00:03:54.700
An automated test adds the order desk's decision in the visible form.

16
00:03:54.740 --> 00:04:08.820
The decision approves this purchase order, customer and exact version.

17
00:04:08.820 --> 00:04:12.220
Saving the decision resumes the held order.

18
00:04:12.260 --> 00:04:15.220
The workflow checks the order against its approval before creating the sales order.

19
00:04:15.940 --> 00:04:32.820
The demo ERP board brings the new sales order into view.

20
00:04:32.860 --> 00:04:42.940
The approved order becomes one sales order on the demo ERP board.

21
00:04:53.940 --> 00:05:00.180
The resent purchase order is marked duplicate, keeping the original sales order.
